*.ply

# Scene files live in Cloudflare R2, not here.
# Four scenes come to 175 MB, git keeps every version forever, and GitHub
# rejects a single file over 100 MB. Upload with:
#   rclone copy assets r2:4d-scenes --include "*.sog4d" --progress
assets/*
# Audio tracks are the exception: a few tens of kilobytes, not forty megabytes,
# so they belong in the repo. Keeping them here also avoids a second CORS
# surface on R2 for a file this size. Note the pattern above must be
# `assets/*` and not `assets/`: excluding the directory itself stops git
# descending into it, and a negation below would never be reached.
!assets/*.m4a

# Source maps. A map embeds the complete source of every file in the bundle,
# including upstream's, and was 12 MB of a 22 MB payload. Release builds do
# not emit them; this keeps a debug build from being published by accident.
*.map
assets/tim_drums_local_test.sog4d
.app_backup_before_audio/
